     "size": 1
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §§715-b, 716, 717, 718 & 720-a, N-PC L",
    "lawSection": "Not-for-Profit Corporation Law",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S2267\n\nSPONSOR: COMRIE\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the not-for-profit corporation law, in relation to the\nregulation of key persons\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nTo add key persons to the list of persons to whom certain policies\napply.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 amends subparagraph 715-b (b)(4) of NFP Corporations Law to\nadd \"key person\" to the list of individuals subject to the provisions of\nthat section.\n\nSection 2 amends NFP Corporations Law section 716 to add \"key person\" to\nthe list of persons subject to the provisions of that section.\n\nSection 3 amends NFP Corporations Law section 717 to add \"key person\" to\nthe list of persons subject to the provisions of that section.\n\nSection 4 amends NFP Corporations Law section 718 to add \"key persons\"\nto the list of persons subject to the provisions of that section.\n\nSection 5 amends NFP Corporation Law section 720-a to add \"key person\"\nto the list of persons subject to the provisions of that section.\n\nSection 6 provides the effective date.\n\n \nEXISTING LAW:\n\nThe Not-for-Profit Corporations Law includes various provisions relating\nto key persons.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nSubstantial amendments were made in 2013 to the Not-for-Profit Corpo-\nrations Law, including provisions regarding key persons within such\ncorporations. Other provisions related to officers, directors and\nemployees of such corporations. This bill expands on those amendments to\nadd \"key person\" to several sections recognizing the importance that key\npersons can play in certain not for profit corporations.  This bill was\nintroduced at the request of the Law Revision Commission.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n2018: A.10654 Passed Assembly / S.8216 Committed to Rules\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nImmediately.\n",
